<title>USA: Peru seeks 20,000-25,000 T optional durum - trade.</title>
<headline>Peru seeks 20,000-25,000 T optional durum - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru will tender on Tuesday for between 20,000 and 25,000 tonnes optional origin durum, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>One exporter said he believed the durum to be of U.S. origin. Shipment date was slated for March 15-April 15.</p>
<p>Estimated date of arrival was by April 30, another exporter said.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
